dsh-superpowers
===============

dsh-superpowers is a DeepSeek Harness (DSH) adaptation of "Superpowers" —
obra/superpowers, https://github.com/obra/superpowers.

- Repository: https://github.com/stillU/dsh-superpowers
- Adapter maintained by stillU; DSH adaptation copyright (c) 2026 stillU.

- Upstream project: obra/superpowers v6.3.0 (2026-08-12), MIT License.
- The contents of skills/ are vendored VERBATIM from the upstream repository at
  origin/main b36e0829c6d0140e93cfef2ca599b1b07d4a7797 (v6.3.0). Skill bodies
  are intentionally unmodified; see SOURCES.md for full provenance.
- The only file added inside the vendored tree is
  skills/using-superpowers/references/dsh-tools.md — a tool-mapping reference
  for DeepSeek Harness, the DSH analog of the upstream references/*-tools.md
  files. Its canonical copy lives at references/dsh-tools.md.
